AltoConvexCreditLineMarket::liquidate()
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert with IsPaused for PAUSE_TYPE
├── when market is frozen but not paused
│   └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketNonLiquidatable
└── when market is active
    └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketNonLiquidatable for every borrower and data input
